{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"d2887c4e-0cfd-45e8-bdcd-ca3001c3e016","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I have implemented all the analytics events specified in [`docs/EVENTS.md`](file:///tmp/h-KpBGSz/docs/EVENTS.md) on the registration and offers screens using the wrapper [`Analytics.capture`](file:///tmp/h-KpBGSz/lib/analytics.dart#L13-L14). The documentation of the changes and how the colleague's note was applied has been written to [`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-KpBGSz/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Implementation:\n- **`registration_email_started`** \u0026 **`registration_phone_started`** in [`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`](file:///tmp/h-KpBGSz/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart): Fired once per screen visit on first keystroke via `_emailStartedFired` and `_phoneStartedFired` state flags to prevent spamming events on every keystroke.\n- **`loan_amount_changed`** in [`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`](file:///tmp/h-KpBGSz/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart): Fired in `Slider.onChangeEnd` with `{'amount': v.round()}` so events are only captured when the user finishes dragging.\n- **`terms_accepted`** in [`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`](file:///tmp/h-KpBGSz/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart): Fired in `CheckboxListTile.onChanged` only when checked (`accepted \u0026\u0026 !_terms`).\n- **`registration_continue_tapped`** in [`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart`](file:///tmp/h-KpBGSz/lib/screens/registration_screen.dart): Fired in `FilledButton.onPressed` with `{'amount': _amount.round(), 'terms': _terms}`.\n- **`offers_scrolled`** in [`lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`](file:///tmp/h-KpBGSz/lib/screens/offer_screen.dart): Captured by wrapping `ListView.builder` in a `NotificationListener\u003cScrollEndNotification\u003e` with `{'offset': notification.metrics.pixels}`, firing only when the scroll movement completes.\n","duration_seconds":113.251255,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":237807,"output_tokens":5206,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":166825,"total_tokens":243013}}}
